<p dir="auto">Adds anchors for all the fields in the <code class="notranslate">chrome_settings_overrides</code> web extensions docs so they can be directly linked to.</p>

<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">I wanted to share a link to the <code class="notranslate">search_provider</code> section but it is currently awkward to share a direct link to the right position as you can only use the "Copy link to highlight" version<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Add-ons/WebExtensions/manifest.json/chrome_settings_overrides#search_url:~:text=Defines%20a%20search%20provider%20to%20add%20to%20the%20browser" rel="nofollow">0</a>, and even then it doesn't scroll as nicely as it does with an explicit anchor on the row imo.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<details open="" class="details-reset border rounded-2">
  <summary class="px-3 py-2">
    <svg aria-hidden="true" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" data-view-component="true" class="octicon octicon-device-camera-video">
